{
  "dom_id": "step-15722",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Calculating Sums and Scalar Multiplication of Column Vectors",
  "problem": "Let ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14252434/assets/fb9b955cc4075fbf557fc6318a1f578f7bb722d6752c05534573f752b2b87fe4.svg) ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14252434/assets/2a0079ed4821f4419c9ab8baed0f761a6c71e33506f3834227338bf2d7656867.svg) and ![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14252434/assets/bbae66721df89b2b0daff1559e0294c1e286f893df6a0736ac1ad5ae337249ca.svg) Find $2\\mathbf{a}-(\\mathbf{b}-5\\mathbf{c}).$",
  "worked_solution": "To compute the result, we just need to perform the required operations with each component separately:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2a-(b-5c) & =2\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -5\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]-5\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]-([\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-15 \\\\ 35\\end{aligned}]) \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ -10\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}17 \\\\ -31\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-15 \\\\ 21\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
